---
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Brazilian Waxing Training Guide | brazilianwax.education';
const description =
  'How students and salon owners search for Brazilian waxing training, certification, and business education — and why brazilianwax.education is for sale, not an enrollment page.';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path="/brazilian-waxing-training/"
  article
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Brazilian waxing training', path: '/brazilian-waxing-training/' },
  ]}
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <header class="bg-[#2D2D2D] text-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-[#E8A07A] mb-3">NOT AN ENROLLMENT PAGE</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Brazilian waxing training, the way people actually search
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/75 leading-relaxed">
          This guide is published by the owner of brazilianwax.education to show what the name
          covers. If you want a course, contact a licensed academy. If you want the domain,
          <a class="underline decoration-[#B85C38] underline-offset-4 hover:text-white" href="/acquire/"
            >make an offer</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-10 text-[#3C3C3C]">
      <section class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2D2D2D]">What Brazilian waxing training covers</h2>
        <p>
          Professional Brazilian waxing training typically includes anatomy, consultation and
          contraindications, hard-wax and soft-wax technique for intimate areas, sanitation,
          aftercare, and client communication. Strong programs also teach business basics: pricing,
          booking flow, retail add-ons, and how to build a recurring client book.
        </p>
        <p>
          Demand stays high because Brazilian waxing is a recurring salon service. Technicians who
          train well can move into booth rental, mobile service, or their own studio. That dual
          “skills + business” intent is exactly what brazilianwax.education encodes in the URL.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2D2D2D]">Phrases students and owners type</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Searchers mix the service name with education intent. A category domain that already
          contains those words is easier to brand, advertise, and remember than a generic LMS URL.
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto clean-section rounded-2xl">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm sm:text-base">
            <thead class="bg-[#F8F1E9] text-[#2D2D2D]">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3 font-semibold">What they type</th>
                <th class="p-3 font-semibold">What they mean</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#EDE4D7]">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3">Brazilian waxing training</td>
                <td class="p-3">Hands-on or online certification</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3">Brazilian wax course</td>
                <td class="p-3">A structured curriculum</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3">epilation certification</td>
                <td class="p-3">Credential for salon work</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3">waxing business class</td>
                <td class="p-3">Startup and pricing skills</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3">intimate waxing academy</td>
                <td class="p-3">Specialized school brand</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2D2D2D]">Why the .education TLD matters</h2>
        <p>
          The .education extension signals training, certification, and expertise at a glance. Paired
          with exact keywords for Brazilian waxing, the domain reads as an academy brand before a
          visitor even lands. That clarity helps paid ads, email, partnerships, and word-of-mouth —
          independent of any SEO score.
        </p>
        <p>
          Domain Authority (DA) is not sold with a name. Moz DA and similar metrics rise when other
          sites link to yours over time. What you buy here is a memorable, category-defining address
          and a clean place to publish. Rankings still depend on content, backlinks, and trust.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2D2D2D]">Who typically buys a name like this</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Esthetician schools adding a Brazilian waxing specialty track</li>
          <li>Online course creators packaging technique + business modules</li>
          <li>Multi-location salons standardizing staff training under one portal</li>
          <li>Wax product brands that need a professional education hub</li>
          <li>Workshop organizers running bootcamps and masterclasses</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section
        class="clean-section rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#F8F1E9]/60 space-y-3 leading-relaxed"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2D2D2D]">Ready to acquire the domain?</h2>
        <p>
          brazilianwax.education is listed for acquisition. Asking price is $9,500 USD. Escrow.com is
          preferred. This page is not a school and does not take tuition.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/acquire/#inquire"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-6 py-3 bg-[#B85C38] hover:bg-[#A04E30] text-white font-semibold rounded-2xl transition-all"
        >
          Make an offer
        </a>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
